gbgM(){return"Lads, we're at home today. These stands are ours, this grass is ours."},
gbgN(){return"We're in front of our own fans. They're waiting for us, and we owe them."},
gbgO(){return"This is our ground, boys. Nobody comes here and plays at ease."},
gbgD(){return"We're away, lads. The stands are theirs, but it's eleven against eleven out there."},
gbgE(){return"Nobody here is going to help us. Whatever we take, we take ourselves."},
gbgF(){return"We've come a long way, boys. We didn't come to go home empty-handed."},
gbgG(){return"Everyone sees us as favourites. We'll prove it on the pitch, not on paper."},
gbgH(){return"We're expected to win this one. Doing what's expected is a craft too."},
gbgV(){return"We're up against a strong side today. Nobody gives us a chance. Good, let them think that."},
gbgW(){return"A tough evening awaits us. But big teams lose too, lads."},
gbgT(){return"We won't talk about the last game. That chapter is closed; today we turn a new page."},
gbgU(){return"We all felt the last one. Today we answer on the pitch."},
gbgR(){return"We're on a good run, boys. But yesterday's game doesn't score today."},
gbgS(){return"We built this run. Same hunger, same focus, we keep going."},
gbgB(){return"First game of the season, lads. Tonight we set the tone for the whole year."},
gbgC(){return"New season, new story. Tonight we write the first line."},
gbgP(){return"This is a cup tie, lads. Every ball, every duel here means going through."},
gbgQ(){return"There's no second chance in the cup, boys. Whoever wants it more goes through."},
gbgI(){return"It's the final, lads. We worked all season for tonight."},
gbgJ(){return"Everyone in this room earned tonight. Now we go and take that trophy."},
gbgK(){return"It's a friendly, but we stay serious. What you show here is what you'll play in the league."},
gbgL(){return"Today it's more about our game than the result. I want to see what we've practised."},
gbh9(){return"We're going forward today. Pin them back in their own half."},
gbha(){return"The moment we win the ball, we face their goal. No back passes, look forward."},
gbhb(){return"Don't be afraid to shoot. You'll miss some, but the shot you don't take never goes in."},
gbhc(){return"Use the wings, fill the box. Tonight, goals are our job."},
gbhd(){return"Patience. We shut the door; one chance is enough."},
